{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07713","headline":"越中逢天台太乙子 · 孟浩然","name":"越中逢天台太乙子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙穴逢羽人，停舻向前拜。\n问余涉风水，何处远行迈。\n登陆寻天台，顺流下吴会。\n兹山夙所尚，安得问灵怪。\n上逼青天高，俯临沧海大。\n鸡鸣见日出，常觌仙人斾。\n往来赤城中，逍遥白云外。\n莓苔异人间，瀑布当空界。\n福庭长自然，华顶旧称最。\n永此从之游，何当济所届。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}